  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon olive oil, or more as needed",
    "4 (8 ounce) bone-in pork loin chops",
    "1 cup unsweetened pineapple juice",
    "0.5 cup teriyaki sauce",
    "1 teaspoon dried crushed rosemary",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ovRrw4_fQfr6esgG3olnCclF2Y8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/279593-slow-cooker-pineapple-teriyaki-pork-chops-recipe-VAT-Step-1-17c20e837ce94c13aa9406eb91255b31.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279593/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a skillet over medium-high heat. Add pork chops and brown for about 3 minutes. Transfer chops to a slow cooker.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iPxxEMlMbnHrbGVgjf180szQXvk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/279593-slow-cooker-pineapple-teriyaki-pork-chops-recipe-VAT-Step-2-e8438910a92347f1aa022a8292916a57.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279593/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine pineapple juice, teriyaki sauce, rosemary, garlic powder, salt, and pepper in a bowl. Pour over pork chops.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/o5aDEPP0KirBtknonKCoeo8qEbs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/279593-slow-cooker-pineapple-teriyaki-pork-chops-recipe-VAT-Step-3-1d987b7eea2243d8a54b2425ea0d3dc6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279593/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and cook on Low, 4 to 5 hours. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read 145 degrees F (63 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lHCWWjYKKhWtCJJpIucoOtSAkas=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/279593-slow-cooker-pineapple-teriyaki-pork-chops-recipe-VAT-Step-4-de725bd93f294d69a87581f0386ad2d8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279593/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
